  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att konsolidera tidigare st&#xf6;d till RGA genom svenska Lantm&#xe4;teriet inom sex olika kompoenter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aming at sustaining results acheived during phase I and II. The objective is to strenghten and sustain capacity and competence of the RGA to realize its development goal. The project will support development of a quality control system to assure the quality of data in registers, digital archive system, mortgage system and concept for mass appraisal of real property taxation.</narrative>
  </description>
